<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-11-03T17:58:01.363Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 17:58:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The United States carried out limited strikes on Iran’s Qeshm Island, and Iran said it would reopen the Strait of Hormuz within two days if the United States meets its conditions. Iran warned of a new battlefield after the reported U.S. strike, while Israeli officials called for new strikes on Iran and a missile hit a building in Tel Aviv. Gulf Arab states expressed concern over the war cloud as negotiations continue with Qatari mediators and U.S. officials. 123 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/03/us-strikes-irans-qeshm-island-ahead-of-midterm-elections&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/02/iran-says-it-can-reopen-hormuz-in-two-days-if-us-meets-conditions&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/yemen-houthi-clashes-near-taiz-leave-residents-in-a-state-of-panic/a-79836913?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/03/iran-warns-of-new-battlefield-after-reported-us-strike-on-qeshm&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/nov/02/oil-price-falls-amid-hope-of-a-breakthrough-to-end-iran-war&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOTk5HV0lxVUVFaFJENXVwV1BiX0x4X2FxbFRQYXBMN3Z5VzFLaHgxNkxuMjFxWkFrMjh0akZHSHpKcFE1VEh5UkFKTUhzWWpOYk9UeHVlTHNhMW0yWFhmZ3B6VW5JLTZ4dEE3eHNPNDlNcGpfbEJCMXFxX3F4S3Ricm9HeWZhTDJlazhvdVhJbE90QUFMVHZkUEJsUGdkZ2VMamNEX2lzOHU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/02/world/middleeast/iran-deal-strait-of-hormuz.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95c